  "description": "With perfect specs and face, Lee Seung-Woo has lived a life loved by both men and women, yet he is an upright, chaste man who has never once \"done\" love. For him, love was something he could pursue whenever he set his mind to it. That was his belief until he met the impenetrable Baek Su-Rin. “Noona, think objectively.” “With this face, with this body… how often do you find a virgin who likes you?” “Noona, there’s no one in my department as pure as me.” Completely smitten with Su-Rin, Seung-Woo tries to emphasize his virginity...\nSource: MU",
